{"id":"211a4101b02c699d","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-prop-change-of-variable.md","title":"Itô's Lemma","display":"prop-change-of-variable — Itô's Lemma","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-change-of-variable","aliases":["58-prop-change-of-variable"],"display":"prop-change-of-variable — Itô's Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-change-of-variable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-change-of-variable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-change-of-variable — Itô's Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c462e4cd1ccada77\" href=\"?note=c462e4cd1ccada77\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md\">../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"263379658f1ae518\" href=\"?note=263379658f1ae518\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md\">../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\">\\(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S\\)</span> are the predicates from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c462e4cd1ccada77\" href=\"?note=c462e4cd1ccada77\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md\">../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}change\\text{-}of\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}change\\text{-}of\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Itô's lemma is the chain rule for stochastic calculus.</li>\n<li>The extra term comes from quadratic variation.</li>\n<li>The conclusion is quantified over nonnegative times; the previous display left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span> free.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md","status":"resolved","id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md","status":"resolved","id":"263379658f1ae518","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-stochastic-integral.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md","status":"resolved","id":"c462e4cd1ccada77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S$ and $\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S$ are the predicates from [[../batch19/58-df-ito-lemma.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}change\\text{-}of\\text{-}variable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ItoProcess}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet)\n\\land f\\in C^2(\\mathbb R)\n\\to\\forall t\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\n\\mathrm{ItoFormula}_S(X,\\mu,\\sigma,B,f,t,\\Omega,\\mathcal F,\\mathbb P,\\mathcal F_\\bullet).","display":true},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1092,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3942","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-prop-change-of-variable.md|58-prop-change-of-variable]]（batch08）"}],"outgoing":["c462e4cd1ccada77","263379658f1ae518"]}